{"ID":"20240314091855-2u4r2bv","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091855-2u4r2bv","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091855-2u4r2bv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170034-zbmptf9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170034-9tvzafb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170034-9tvzafb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:81,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:81\u0026#125;","title":"【橘皮竹茹汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422170034"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422170034-zbmptf9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422170034-zbmptf9","updated":"20240422170034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"哕逆者，橘皮竹茹汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170034-c7zutx6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170034-c7zutx6","updated":"20240422170034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"橘皮竹茹汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170034-2ko3kgj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170034-2ko3kgj","updated":"20240422170034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"橘皮二升竹茹二升大枣三十枚生姜半斤甘草五两人参一两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170034-2sn93w7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170034-2sn93w7","updated":"20240422170034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右六味，以水一斗，煮取三升，温服一升，日三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170034-fts9wez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170034-fts9wez","updated":"20240422170034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"像这个呢，这个是如果你遇到一个病人"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"打嗝，但是口渴的很严重，就是他吐哕逆的时候，吐了很多胃的津液出来，那这个时候用竹茹"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，竹茹是止渴的。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"临床上我们在用竹茹的时候，淋巴结肿，扁桃腺肿，腮腺肿，甲状腺肿，糖尿病，竹茹都很好用"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以竹茹在经方里面是一个很好的一个药。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"会用到人参就告诉大家这个人嗝逆的、哕逆的时候津液吐得很多，津液伤到，只要津液伤到张仲景都会用人参"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，对不对？那这里有生姜、甘草啊、红枣就补他的津液...然后橘皮汤，加了竹茹在里面，那这个...这可以说是胃里虚热，如果我们用阴阳表里虚实寒热来区分的话，这胃里是虚热，这两个嗝逆的处方，那是因为胃家的虚热。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170034-1z3xsx5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170034-1z3xsx5","updated":"20240422170034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果你遇到萎症，这个病人是肝癌肝硬化胃癌或者怎么样子，他那种到了末期打嗝的时候，按照伤寒论来说这个是死症，那你不能说，你死啦，准备死啦，对不对？我们总是要再出手救，救的时候最好用的是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓四逆汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，所以会用到茯苓四逆汤的时候就是最后一搏。那"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这是最重的嗝逆的时候，胃气要绝的时候使用的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这种胃气要绝的时候，你用橘皮什么竹茹汤啊橘皮汤啊那个都没有用的，那个不对症。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个胃气要绝的时候，里面是寒，而且是非常的湿，内脏又有实，胃里面是寒实，就因为内脏是寒实造成胃里面是寒湿，所以胃气要绝了，这个时候你要用茯苓四逆汤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。因为是寒，所以我们会有生附子，还有干姜，因为有湿在里面，所以我们要茯苓把湿排掉，这个时候你不用白术了，为什么？因为生附子非常的热，生附子一下去的时候在心脏周围一直到小肠，这中间的一段全部都会热起来，一热的时候湿就开始动了。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170034-9tvzafb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170034-9tvzafb","updated":"20240422170034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"急救应急的时候我们要药简力专，所以你生附子一下去的时候，直接茯苓一下去就把中焦的水排掉，所以茯苓呢是利三焦的水，三焦是水道出焉，所以茯苓四逆汤。他原因就是这样的。"}]}]}